					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-217108#post-2481981</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-217108/scp-889#post-2481981</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 30 Mar 2016 17:12:07 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>SunRat</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2206367</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>One of the more interesting SCPs out there, particularly with regard to the pictures. One minor flaw I would recommend correcting is replacing the reference to taxonomic &quot;kingdoms&quot;, since that is an increasingly anachronistic category, with something that elaborates a bit more on the incompatibilities. Just a nitpick though.</p> <p>My biggest concern is that the article fails to address one extremely important question: Can this be used to breed <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Catgirl">catgirls</a>? The future of humanity rests on the answer.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
